{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43318","headline":"华林园早梅 · 郑述诚","name":"华林园早梅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓日东楼路，林端见早梅。\n独凌寒气发，不逐衆花开。\n素彩风前艳，韶光雪後催。\n蘂香沾紫陌，枝亚拂青苔。\n止渴曾爲用，和羹旧有才。\n含情欲攀折，瞻望几裴回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑述诚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43318.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43318","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}